#: ../../index.md:8 b4a29e18b24840769564c13b6c92ac04
msgid "Bookshelf"
msgstr "Bookshelf"

#: ../../index.md:22 fc3d06c05e644c9e85efa7d1ab73334b
msgid "🕵️ What is Bookshelf?"
msgstr "🕵️‍♂️ Qu'est-ce que Bookshelf ?"

#: ../../index.md:24 38fa1b2ae4104d26b6f378e5c44354fe
msgid ""
"Bookshelf (formerly known as Gunivers Libs) is a modular library datapack"
" designed to simplify complex systems in Minecraft maps. It is ideal for "
"mapmakers seeking easy-to-implement tools."
msgstr ""
"Bookshelf (anciennement Gunivers Libs) est une bibliothèque de datapacks "
"modulaire conçue pour simplifier les systèmes complexes dans les maps "
"Minecraft. Elle est idéale pour les map makers cherchant des outils "
"faciles à implémenter."

#: ../../index.md:31 6b572b5e0c8f4712bf9fcec714eeebb0
msgid "🚀 Quickstart!"
msgstr "🚀 Guide de démarrage rapide !"

#: ../../index.md:42 f4ecad124af2480ea955d033e0a45158
msgid "🎬 Watch trailer"
msgstr "🎬 Regarder le trailer"

#: ../../index.md:55 ac6ed03eb26d45e299a2692e04a3fa58
msgid "🌟 Featured Modules"
msgstr "🌟 Modules en vedette"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:5 d02718a9cb1e4b1991f63c409ef47973
msgid "🧱 Block"
msgstr "🧱 Blocs"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:10 a6167ecf447c4f17b45e69f95ff12d17
msgid "Get and manipulate blocks (supports BlockStates and NBT)."
msgstr "Obtenir et manipuler les blocs (supporte les BlockStates et NBT)."

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:13 3214e76d878b491da80dc60189020a17
msgid "🔦 Raycast"
msgstr "🔦 Raycast"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:18 7b68f2cf0f9846efad96c9cb8629bd5b
msgid "Cast rays and see if they collide with blocks or entities."
msgstr "Lancer des rayons et voir s'ils entrent en collision avec des blocs ou des entités."

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:21 17407d9a3e2d4ca28a6a03e15493a205
msgid "🧮 Math"
msgstr "🧮 Mathématiques"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:26 46bd68f3cc6e4068acd9aa7b7b4f1243
msgid "Mathematical functions: sin, cos, exp, log, sqrt, and much more!"
msgstr "Fonctions mathématiques : sin, cos, exp, log, sqrt, et bien plus !"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:29 0ae92eb54c404df0ad8154f67a685741
msgid "🏗️ Generation"
msgstr "🏗️ Génération"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:34 b29f3dd2353346b28570da83d89d9c40
msgid "Generate terrains and landscapes, incorporating natural features."
msgstr "Générer des terrains et paysages, intégrant des caractéristiques naturelles."

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:37 3c490e54f3bb4a618e0930e8515ff08a
msgid "🎲 Random"
msgstr "🎲 Aléatoire"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:42 50b3b781905f4a3eb354bb3bf3a2725d
msgid "Random functions for different distributions and noise patterns."
msgstr "Fonctions aléatoires pour différentes distributions et motifs de bruit."

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:45 b46ad4d8f35b4238b67bcb49e4bf6f9c
msgid "❤️ Health"
msgstr "❤️ Santé"

#: ../../_templates/featured-modules.md:50 f3062be1775d4b77b4aa854d5cc68747
msgid "Easily manage the health of a player or the lifetime of an entity!"
msgstr "Gérez facilement la santé d'un joueur ou la durée de vie d'une entité !"


#: ../../index.md:62 bbc800791cc14ca7a709df81baa3ec1f
msgid "🔥 Motivation"
msgstr "🔥 Motivation"

#: ../../index.md:64 a008b4bcd3c74e70a2db19f079fabe88
msgid ""
"As developers, we understand the value of libraries: they save time, "
"streamline workflows, and eliminate the need to reinvent the wheel. "
"However, we have noticed that many mapmakers in the Minecraft community "
"are less familiar with this concept."
msgstr ""
"En tant que développeurs, nous comprenons la valeur des bibliothèques : elles "
"font gagner du temps, rationalisent les workflows et évitent de "
"réinventer la roue. Cependant, nous avons remarqué que de nombreux "
"map makers dans la communauté Minecraft sont moins familiers avec "
"ce concept."

#: ../../index.md:66 3c60f7b90f374ca28b57455f80a7c3b4
msgid ""
"That is why we started this project: to provide a variety of reusable "
"tools and encourage mapmakers to embrace the use of libraries."
msgstr ""
"C'est pourquoi nous avons commencé ce projet : fournir une variété "
"d'outils réutilisables et encourager les map makers à adopter "
"l'utilisation de bibliothèques."

#: ../../index.md:68 65c75eaade4342c995c5f659bd146d9f
msgid ""
"While we strive to keep our modules as optimized as possible, our top "
"priority is accessibility. We focus on creating features that are easy to"
" use and simple to install, ensuring they are practical for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Bien que nous nous efforcions de maintenir nos modules aussi optimisés "
"que possible, notre priorité absolue est l'accessibilité. Nous nous "
"concentrons sur la création de fonctionnalités faciles à utiliser et "
"simples à installer, garantissant qu'elles soient pratiques pour tous."

#: ../../index.md:71 f461e42034df4c88a030a789e9054168
msgid ""
"\"I have seen further than others because I have stood on the shoulders "
"of giants.\""
msgstr ""
"\"J'ai vu plus loin que les autres parce que je me suis tenu sur les "
"épaules de géants.\""

#: ../../index.md:72 aa5e1a91429d4c278721891b9a14b2cf
msgid "Isaac Newton"
msgstr "Isaac Newton"

#: ../../index.md:76 0f0612345f7a4afc8fa8603c488f9be6
msgid "🤝 Contribution"
msgstr "🤝 Contribution"

#: ../../index.md:78 8cf472de39f543eaaa145b6000d321bb
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about the project or want to discuss something,"
" join [our Discord](https://discord.gg/aV5SF3JsAZ) server."
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez des questions sur le projet ou souhaitez discuter de "
"quelque chose, rejoignez notre serveur "
"[Discord](https://discord.gg/aV5SF3JsAZ)."

#: ../../index.md:80 2f1549b254e9472bbdfa4591364957d1
msgid ""
"If you want to contribute, please refer to the [contribution "
"docs](https://docs.mcbookshelf.dev/en/latest/contribute/index.html) for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Si vous souhaitez contribuer, veuillez vous référer à la "
"[documentation de contribution](https://docs.mcbookshelf.dev/en/latest/contribute/index.html) "
"pour plus d'informations."
